LABEL 900.00 84.00 AUTO (click):\nthe plant runs\nbatches.
LABEL 200.00 490.00 DOSING (flow chart, every scan):\nthe valve of the material that is\nshort opens; at the set point the\nbatch is ready and starts Mixing.
LABEL 470.00 700.00 MIXING (timeline, one cycle per batch): V7.53 empties\nWI7.50 into T3, V8.03 adds the additives, VT3 sends\nthe hot batch to T4, VT4 blows it to silo H9.3.
